; A header that goes on on the next line fails at its own line's end, so
; the account written there is never read and its name not checked: only
; the line that continues the open is reported, not the account type that
; the option renamed.
option "name_assets" "Activa"

2020-01-01 open
  Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 open Activa:Kept
